<entry thead="no"><para>GATE-ANA-BM-04  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>ANA-BM-04  </para>
</entry><entry thead="no"><para>p99 ≤ 5 µs/flush  </para>
</entry></row>
</table>
</para>
<para>All benchmarks:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Use kAnalyticsCanonicalSeed = 42 for deterministic data.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Warm up for kWarmupIterations before measurement.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Run with Repetitions(kRepetitions) for variance estimation.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
